  "description": "Find the lexicographically largest substring of a string s.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1: let i = 0, j = 1, k = 0\n2: while j + k < s.length:\n3:   if s[i + k] == s[j + k]: k++\n4:   else if s[i + k] < s[j + k]: i = max(i + k + 1, j), j = i + 1, k = 0\n5:   else: j = j + k + 1, k = 0\n6: return s.substring(i)",
